{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q784717","formula":"C₂₃H₂₄N₂O₄S","hill":"C23H24N2O4S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":23.0,"H":24.0,"N":2.0,"O":4.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Eprosartan","uk":"Епросартан"},"descriptions":{"en":"Eprosartan, sold under the brand name Teveten among others, is an angiotensin II receptor antagonist used for the treatment of high blood pressure. Eprosartan is sometimes paired with hydrochlorothiazide. As with other angiotensin II receptor antagonists, eprosartan is generally better tolerated than enalapril (an ACE inhibitor), especially among the elderly.","uk":"Епросартан — синтетичний антигіпертензивний препарат, що належить до групи антагоністів рецепторів ангіотензину-ІІ, для перорального застосування. Епросартан розроблений у співпраці науковців двох фармацевтичних компаній «Abbott Laboratories» та «Kos Pharmaceuticals», які отримали ліцензію на препарат у 2006 році, пізніше права на епросартан були передані канадській компанії «Biovail Corporation»."},"fame":21,"pubchemCid":5281037,"mass":424.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCCC1=NC=C(N1CC2=CC=C(C=C2)C(=O)O)/C=C(\\CC3=CC=CS3)/C(=O)O","inchikey":"OROAFUQRIXKEMV-LDADJPATSA-N","iupac":"4-[[2-butyl-5-[(E)-2-carboxy-3-thiophen-2-ylprop-1-enyl]imidazol-1-yl]methyl]benzoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5281037","atoms":54,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.028,"y":-0.537,"z":1.717,"el":"S"},{"x":-3.605,"y":-1.628,"z":-1.487,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.334,"y":-0.012,"z":-3.064,"el":"O"},{"x":3.309,"y":-4.906,"z":1.603,"el":"O"},{"x":1.298,"y":-5.663,"z":0.863,"el":"O"},{"x":1.059,"y":1.346,"z":-0.732,"el":"N"},{"x":0.867,"y":2.93,"z":0.813,"el":"N"},{"x":1.706,"y":2.161,"z":0.154,"el":"C"},{"x":3.205,"y":2.143,"z":0.318,"el":"C"},{"x":3.782,"y":3.56,"z":0.367,"el":"C"}